---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — Alex Herek"
  description="The terms governing your use of alexherek.com."
  altPath="/pl/terms"
>
  <main class="narrow">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Terms of Use</div>

    <div class="page-header">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--gold);">LEGAL</span>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: [DATE] &middot; Effective for alexherek.com</p>
    </div>

    <div class="draft-note">
      DRAFT TEMPLATE — this is a structural starting point, not legal advice. Have this reviewed by a qualified attorney before publishing, especially around intellectual property, liability limitations, and any consumer-protection rules in the regions where you sell.
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your access to and use of alexherek.com (the "Site"), operated by Alex Herek. By using the Site, you agree to these Terms.</p>

      <h2>Use of the Site</h2>
      <p>The Site and its content — including illustrations, book descriptions, and blog posts — are provided for your personal, non-commercial use. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from our content without permission.</p>

      <h2>Purchases</h2>
      <p>Books referenced on this Site are sold through Amazon and other third-party retailers. Purchases, returns, and order issues are subject to that retailer's own terms and policies — we do not process payments or fulfill orders directly through this Site.</p>

      <h2>Free samples and email sign-up</h2>
      <p>Free sample pages are provided for personal use only and may not be resold, redistributed, or used commercially. By requesting a sample, you agree to receive an email delivering that content, and optionally further updates, which you can unsubscribe from at any time.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>All illustrations, logos, book covers, and written content on this Site are the property of Alex Herek unless otherwise noted, and are protected by copyright and trademark law.</p>

      <h2>No professional advice</h2>
      <p>Content on this Site — including blog posts about child development, memory, or cognitive health — is provided for general informational and entertainment purposes only. It is not medical, psychological, or educational professional advice. Please consult a qualified professional for guidance specific to your situation.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>The Site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. Alex Herek is not liable for any damages arising from your use of the Site, to the fullest extent permitted by law.</p>

      <h2>Changes to these Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted means you accept the updated Terms.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@alexherek.com">hello@alexherek.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  main.narrow { padding-bottom: 60px; }
  a { color: var(--coral-deep); }
  .page-header { padding: 36px 0 10px; }
  .page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; color: var(--navy); margin-top: 10px; }
  .page-header .meta { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 12px; }
  .draft-note {
    background: rgba(198,153,47,.1); border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); padding: 16px 18px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 26px 0 36px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }
  .prose { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink); }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--navy); margin: 34px 0 12px; }
  .prose p { margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
</style>
